{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OVERVIEW</h2><br>THE KNIGHT OF NEPHIART is a classic RPG for VR in which you lead a party as a knight to fight against the Demon King.<br>A player can experience the adventure in a fantasy world while looking around 360 degrees in VR.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1878020/extras/b2c883479d2b44aa185de9d08163da14.poster.avif?t=1733727269\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1878020/extras/b2c883479d2b44aa185de9d08163da14.webm?t=1733727269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1878020/extras/b2c883479d2b44aa185de9d08163da14.mp4?t=1733727269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The battle system uses a turn-based command input.<br>With an old-school system feel let you play right away, without any learning.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1878020/extras/6a2b9cf5b41e4f8a454be017e2d7895a.poster.avif?t=1733727269\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1878020/extras/6a2b9cf5b41e4f8a454be017e2d7895a.webm?t=1733727269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1878020/extras/6a2b9cf5b41e4f8a454be017e2d7895a.mp4?t=1733727269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Relive your imagination in your youth, 'Diving into the imaginary world' with VR !<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2><br>The royal family of the kingdom of NEPHIART has brought peace to the kingdom through the power of light passed down from generation to generation.<br>The family undergoes the holy land trials in order to awaken the special power.<br>A knight of the kingdom accepts an order to escort the princess to the holy land and sets off with her.<br><br>They travel around the holy land and the princess undergoes trials.<br>Their conventional journey to awaken the special power takes a sudden turn when something strange happens at the royal palace.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1878020?t=1733727269","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1878020?t=1733727269","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1878020/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1733727269","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1878020/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1733727269","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OVERVIEW</h2><br>THE KNIGHT OF NEPHIART is a classic RPG for VR in which you lead a party as a knight to fight against the Demon King.<br>A player can experience the adventure in a fantasy world while looking around 360 degrees in VR.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1878020/extras/b2c883479d2b44aa185de9d08163da14.poster.avif?t=1733727269\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1878020/extras/b2c883479d2b44aa185de9d08163da14.webm?t=1733727269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1878020/extras/b2c883479d2b44aa185de9d08163da14.mp4?t=1733727269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The battle system uses a turn-based command input.<br>With an old-school system feel let you play right away, without any learning.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1878020/extras/6a2b9cf5b41e4f8a454be017e2d7895a.poster.avif?t=1733727269\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1878020/extras/6a2b9cf5b41e4f8a454be017e2d7895a.webm?t=1733727269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1878020/extras/6a2b9cf5b41e4f8a454be017e2d7895a.mp4?t=1733727269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Relive your imagination in your youth, 'Diving into the imaginary world' with VR !<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2><br>The royal family of the kingdom of NEPHIART has brought peace to the kingdom through the power of light passed down from generation to generation.<br>The family undergoes the holy land trials in order to awaken the special power.<br>A knight of the kingdom accepts an order to escort the princess to the holy land and sets off with her.<br><br>They travel around the holy land and the princess undergoes trials.<br>Their conventional journey to awaken the special power takes a sudden turn when something strange happens at the royal palace.","developers":["VR RPG INC."],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1878020/header.jpg?t=1733727269","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"THE KNIGHT OF NEPHIART(TM)<br />\r\nVR RPG INC.(TM)(C)","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1878020/7969